<title>NEW ZEALAND: Utilicorp extends offers for Power NZ shrs.</title>
<headline>Utilicorp extends offers for Power NZ shrs.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utilicorp New Zealand said on Monday it had extended to May 30 its takeover offers for shares in Power New Zealand.</p>
<p>The extension applies to the offers dated May 14 and September 20, 1996.</p>
<p>Utilicorp NZ is a unit of Utilicorp United Inc.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
